    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Pointillist painting of people relaxing on a grassy riverbank under trees, with boats, dogs, and a monkey; all forms built from tiny colored dots.",
      "long": "A large horizontal painting depicting an outdoor leisure scene. The foreground shows multiple figures on green grass: some seated or reclining, others standing or walking. A black dog walks near two seated figures. To the lower right, a small brown dog and a monkey sit beside a tall standing woman holding a black parasol. In the middle ground, additional figures are visible under shaded areas and near watercraft. The background includes a blue-toned body of water with boats, and indistinct vertical shapes suggesting trees or structures. The entire image is constructed from thousands of small, unmixed colored dots—predominantly greens, yellows, blues, reds, and purples—that visually blend when viewed from a distance.",
